['weekly_sales', 'shopping_cart_users', 'bitcoin_members', 'interest_metrics', 'customer_regions', 'customer_transactions', 'bitcoin_transactions', 'customer_nodes', 'cleaned_weekly_sales', 'veg_txn_df', 'shopping_cart_events', 'shopping_cart_page_hierarchy', 'bitcoin_prices', 'interest_map', 'veg_loss_rate_df', 'shopping_cart_campaign_identifier', 'veg_cat', 'veg_whsle_df', 'shopping_cart_event_identifier']
Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns and their potential usage  

veg_whsle_df  
• "whsle_date": extract year to assign each record to 2020‑2023.  
• "item_code": link wholesale records to the master product list.  
• "whsle_px_rmb-kg": wholesale price to be analysed (avg, min, max, totals, etc.).  

veg_txn_df  
• "txn_date": extract year to line‑up selling transactions with wholesale records.  
• "item_code": join key to match products.  
• "unit_selling_px_rmb/kg": selling price needed to calculate revenue and margin.  
• "qty_sold(kg)": multiply by selling price to obtain total selling value.  
• "sale/return": keep only rows where value = 'sale'.  

veg_cat  
• "item_code": join key that maps every vegetable SKU to a category.  
• "category_name": category we want to aggregate by.  

veg_loss_rate_df  
• "item_code": join key that adds a spoilage / shrink factor.  
• "loss_rate_%": loss ratio we’ll use to estimate total loss cost.  

Typical conditions that will be used  
• substr("whsle_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023' – limit to the requested years.  
• substr("txn_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'.  
• "sale/return" = 'sale' – ignore returns.  
• Join veg_whsle_df/veg_txn_df/veg_loss_rate_df ON "item_code".  
• Join to veg_cat ON "item_code" to obtain "category_name".  

Below are ten exploratory SQL queries (from simple to complex) to understand the data and prepare the final financial‑performance report.  
All queries return at most 20 rows and use DISTINCT wherever practical.

```sql
-- 1. Distinct wholesale years that exist in the data set
SELECT DISTINCT substr("whsle_date",1,4) AS "year"
FROM "veg_whsle_df"
WHERE substr("whsle_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Distinct transaction years in the selling data
SELECT DISTINCT substr("txn_date",1,4) AS "year"
FROM "veg_txn_df"
WHERE substr("txn_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. All distinct vegetable categories available
SELECT DISTINCT "category_name"
FROM "veg_cat"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Preview wholesale prices joined to category (sample rows)
SELECT w."whsle_date",
       c."category_name",
       w."item_code",
       w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"
FROM   "veg_whsle_df" AS w
JOIN   "veg_cat"      AS c USING ("item_code")
WHERE  substr(w."whsle_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Yearly wholesale price statistics (avg, max, min) by category
SELECT substr(w."whsle_date",1,4)  AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(AVG(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "avg_whsle_px",
       ROUND(MAX(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "max_whsle_px",
       ROUND(MIN(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "min_whsle_px"
FROM   "veg_whsle_df" AS w
JOIN   "veg_cat"      AS c USING ("item_code")
WHERE  substr(w."whsle_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Yearly total wholesale spend (sum of price) by category
SELECT substr(w."whsle_date",1,4)  AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(SUM(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "total_whsle_price"
FROM   "veg_whsle_df" AS w
JOIN   "veg_cat"      AS c USING ("item_code")
WHERE  substr(w."whsle_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Yearly average selling price & total selling value by category (sales only)
SELECT substr(t."txn_date",1,4)                 AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(AVG(t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg"),2) AS "avg_sell_px",
       ROUND(SUM(t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg" * t."qty_sold(kg)"),2) AS "total_selling_price"
FROM   "veg_txn_df" AS t
JOIN   "veg_cat"    AS c USING ("item_code")
WHERE  substr(t."txn_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
  AND  t."sale/return" = 'sale'
GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Average loss rate (%) per category
SELECT c."category_name",
       ROUND(AVG(l."loss_rate_%"),2) AS "avg_loss_rate_%"
FROM   "veg_loss_rate_df" AS l
JOIN   "veg_cat"          AS c USING ("item_code")
GROUP  BY c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Estimated yearly total loss value by category
SELECT substr(t."txn_date",1,4)                 AS "year",
       c."category_name",
       ROUND(SUM(t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg" * t."qty_sold(kg)" * (l."loss_rate_%"/100.0)),2) AS "total_loss_value"
FROM   "veg_txn_df"       AS t
JOIN   "veg_cat"          AS c USING ("item_code")
JOIN   "veg_loss_rate_df" AS l USING ("item_code")
WHERE  substr(t."txn_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
  AND  t."sale/return" = 'sale'
GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10. Full financial performance snapshot: profit = selling – wholesale – loss
SELECT yr_agg."year",
       yr_agg."category_name",
       yr_agg."avg_whsle_px",
       yr_agg."max_whsle_px",
       yr_agg."min_whsle_px",
       ROUND(yr_agg."max_whsle_px" - yr_agg."min_whsle_px",2) AS "whsle_px_diff",
       yr_agg."total_whsle_price",
       sell."total_selling_price",
       loss."avg_loss_rate_%",             -- Per category (year‑agnostic avg for illustration)
       loss_val."total_loss_value",
       ROUND(sell."total_selling_price" - yr_agg."total_whsle_price" - loss_val."total_loss_value",2) AS "profit"
FROM (
      /* wholesale stats */
      SELECT substr(w."whsle_date",1,4)  AS "year",
             c."category_name",
             ROUND(AVG(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "avg_whsle_px",
             ROUND(MAX(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "max_whsle_px",
             ROUND(MIN(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "min_whsle_px",
             ROUND(SUM(w."whsle_px_rmb-kg"),2) AS "total_whsle_price"
      FROM   "veg_whsle_df" AS w
      JOIN   "veg_cat"      AS c USING ("item_code")
      WHERE  substr(w."whsle_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
      GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
) AS yr_agg
JOIN (
      /* selling totals */
      SELECT substr(t."txn_date",1,4) AS "year",
             c."category_name",
             ROUND(SUM(t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg" * t."qty_sold(kg)"),2) AS "total_selling_price"
      FROM   "veg_txn_df" AS t
      JOIN   "veg_cat"    AS c USING ("item_code")
      WHERE  substr(t."txn_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
        AND  t."sale/return" = 'sale'
      GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
) AS sell
     ON  yr_agg."year" = sell."year"
     AND yr_agg."category_name" = sell."category_name"
LEFT JOIN (
      /* average loss rate per category (same across years unless we add year logic) */
      SELECT c."category_name",
             ROUND(AVG(l."loss_rate_%"),2) AS "avg_loss_rate_%"
      FROM   "veg_loss_rate_df" AS l
      JOIN   "veg_cat"          AS c USING ("item_code")
      GROUP  BY c."category_name"
) AS loss
     ON loss."category_name" = yr_agg."category_name"
LEFT JOIN (
      /* annual total loss value */
      SELECT substr(t."txn_date",1,4) AS "year",
             c."category_name",
             ROUND(SUM(t."unit_selling_px_rmb/kg" * t."qty_sold(kg)" * (l."loss_rate_%"/100.0)),2) AS "total_loss_value"
      FROM   "veg_txn_df"       AS t
      JOIN   "veg_cat"          AS c USING ("item_code")
      JOIN   "veg_loss_rate_df" AS l USING ("item_code")
      WHERE  substr(t."txn_date",1,4) BETWEEN '2020' AND '2023'
        AND  t."sale/return" = 'sale'
      GROUP  BY "year", c."category_name"
) AS loss_val
     ON loss_val."year" = yr_agg."year"
    AND loss_val."category_name" = yr_agg."category_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

The tenth (final) query provides, for every category in each year 2020‑2023, the average, max, and min wholesale prices, their difference, total wholesale outlay, total selling revenue, average loss rate, the monetary value of that loss, and the resulting profit—every numeric rounded to two decimal places.
